            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "List a target owner's entries for a scope (user or workspace).\n\nThe ``require_internal`` injection is redundant with the router-level gate\ntoday, but kept for symmetry with the mutating handlers so the read path\nstays admin-gated even if this router is ever re-mounted standalone."
        },
